  "description": "Royal Rise is the largest station in our Castle Crest series. In Crazy Pink and Sky Blue, it has a central tower with three turrets, tube and spiral slides running outward, rope bridges, a climbing net and swings. From above, the slides and bridges radiate from the middle like spokes, so children spread out instead of queuing at one ladder. It is meant for ages 3 to 12, and play covers climbing, sliding, swinging and hanging. The product area is 42'6\" x 40'5\" and the safe play area is 48'6\" x 46'5\", so plan for a large park, resort or township play zone. Capacity is listed as 15 children. The 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. We can prepare a layout drawing showing paths and seating around it.",
